==Rules==
{{StageRule|13thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Kaijin Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 3.33~5.33 seconds<sup>100f~160f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 5.33~6.67 seconds<sup>160f~200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 2.67~4 seconds<sup>80f~120f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*10 [[Croco]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 10~12 seconds<sup>300f~360f</sup>.
*4 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 21.33 seconds<sup>640f</sup>, delay 6.67~8 seconds<sup>200f~240f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

